-- PLAYER PATH TRACKER + CLOSE-RANGE COMBAT MODE
-- ==========================================================
--
-- FAR AWAY:
--   Roblox PathfindingService handles navigation.
--
-- CLOSE TO TARGET:
--   Pathfinding STOPS.
--   Jumping STOPS.
--   Character holds position close enough to attack.
--   Selected Tool activates.
--
-- BEAM:
--   Visual only.
--
-- ==========================================================

